ath, Greatest Shiva Temple\n\nMust visit during Evenig Retual...\n\nTruly Heaven for All Hindu.......", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2020-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A650A85A5865E24436472D18E2EDE29E", "name": "Shiwani B", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/262shiwanib", "username": "262shiwanib", "avatar": null, "contribution_count": 2, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-09-14", "published_at_date": "2020-09-14"}, {"review_id": 757032483, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r757032483-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "peace and faith", "text": "Ancient temple. Combination of belief nature, culture, heritage  and answer of birth and death. Beyond of imagination", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2020-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "8B0C62DBB8603FA71A0C116E5FB52614", "name": "Zerokilo", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Zerokilonepal", "username": "Zerokilonepal", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/ef/73/default-avatar-2020-13.jpg", "contribution_count": 3, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 3374769, "location_name": "Kathmandu Valley", "location_name_detailed": "Kathmandu Valley, Nepal"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-06-07", "published_at_date": "2020-06-07"}, {"review_id": 755317053, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r755317053-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Calming place", "text": "One of the Hindu temple and have many ancient things to look and Need to be good treatment for poor money", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2020-05-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "20000E3DADBA92510ADAA0CFF29AD64E", "name": "Dave", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/solteema", "username": "solteema", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e7/99/default-avatar-2020-57.jpg", "contribution_count": 17, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 293890, "location_name": "Kathmandu", "location_name_detailed": "Kathmandu, Nepal"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2020-05-22", "published_at_date": "2020-05-22"}, {"review_id": 753494512, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r753494512-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Emptyness", "text": "I was feeling so empty and bored alone in the room. So i searched for good places near to me to visit and i decided to go in Pashupatinath. I found a different synergy there, peace of mind and most important relief. In the name of god i feel blessed, i was fully active by that visit. Some type of energy was with me from there. The best place to get peace of mind. Little Natural little city so nice combination.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "EA7604DD9149EF5C83F49E0AD8993C85", "name": "a SiD Mgr", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/asidmgr2019", "username": "asidmgr2019", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1b/52/43/ac/avatar.jpg", "contribution_count": 10, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 294013, "location_name": "Abu Dhabi", "location_name_detailed": "Abu Dhabi, United Arab Emirates"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1b/52/45/84/fb-img-1589395619416.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2020-05-13", "published_at_date": "2020-05-13"}, {"review_id": 752929105, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r752929105-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Most Sacred Hindu Temple in Nepal", "text": "The Pashupatinath Temple is considered to be the most sacred Hindu Temple in Nepal.  The Temple is located on the banks of the Bagmati River on the eastern side of Kathmandu.  This is where many of the deceased followers of Hinduism are cremated, but not in a closed furnace of a crematorium.  Here in Nepal cremations are done open air, and at this Temple the bodies are covered in cloth and placed on a stone slab right next to the river bank.  Pieces of wood and straw are placed around the body and then it is lit on fire.  After about 3 to 4 hours, the cremation is complete and then the ashes and remains are swept into the river.  This process is part of the Hindu religion that they will be reincarnated.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "589BCA26906657D528F878847AD16AEE", "name": "AZCasualTraveler", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/AZCasualTraveler", "username": "AZCasualTraveler", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1b/b7/33/db/gordon-t.jpg", "contribution_count": 2447, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 31281, "location_name": "Mesa", "location_name_detailed": "Mesa, Arizona"}, "is_